{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "PvP armor: a player's armor mitigates other players' blows as on creatures (#10463, #10462, #10479)",
  "contract": "Requires ClassicPlus.CombatRules=1 (default) and CoA.ItemScaling.Native.RebornArmor=1 (default) with ItemAddon.dbc in the data directory. Level 60 players fight with the vanilla constant: a level 60 attacker's blow keeps 5500 / (armor + 5500) of itself, and armor penetration removes its percentage of min((armor + 5500) / 3, armor) first. A level 60 rating point is 1.1 / 4.2 % of penetration (gtOCTClassCombatRatingScalar and gtCombatRatings). Worn armor is the reborn armor the tooltip shows (ItemAddon.dbc field 43): Titanic Breastplate 982, Dark Iron Leggings 865, Helm of Domination 909. The victim strips its starter shirt, chest, legs and boots first. The Soul attacker learns the 51 rank spells of the build reported for #10463 (coa-development.org talents, spec 80); only Spectre Strength rank 2 touches armor, with 10% penetration.",
